elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_deidentification_boundary", "label": "De-identification Boundary", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reduces PHI surface even though the transport layer is already BAA-covered \u2014 defense in depth. Patient identifiers are stripped/tokenized before leaving the service; a server-side mapping table re-associates the summary with the patient record afterward."}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_prompt_template", "label": "Clinical-Summarization Prompt Template", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_output_contract", "label": "Output JSON Contract", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Claude returns a fixed JSON schema (not free text) so the frontend can render deterministic UI sections rather than parsing prose."}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_chart_summary_endpoint", "label": "POST /internal/chart-summary/{patientId}", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_feedback_endpoint", "label": "POST /internal/chart-summary/{patientId}/feedback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_caching_strategy", "label": "Caching Strategy", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cache per (patient, encounter, data-version-hash), regenerate only if underlying chart data changed; async pre-warm option reduces perceived latency to near-zero at chart open."}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_error_handling", "label": "Error Handling Table", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fail safely: fall back silently to raw chart view on Claude API timeout/error or malformed response (retry once first); return a 'not enough data to summarize' state rather than guessing when the model flags insufficient data."}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_baa_compliance", "label": "BAA Compliance", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_server_side_model_call_decision", "label": "Server-side Model Call Decision", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keeps PHI off the browser/network edge and centralizes BAA compliance."}, {"id": "backend_docs_elation_health_hld_lld_bedrock_decision", "label": "Model Access Path: Bedrock over Direct API", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "elation-health-hld-lld.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Matches Carta's pattern of 'rapid, secure deployment'; simplifies key management and regional 